.TH AVR\-RUN\-CANCEL 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-run-cancel \- Cancel an in-progress or queued workflow run.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr run cancel
[OPTIONS] RUN
.SH DESCRIPTION
Cancel an in-progress or queued workflow run.
.PP
RUN accepts the same Avrea IDs, GitHub run IDs, and run URLs as `avr run view`.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr run cancel run-abc123
    avr run cancel run-abc123 --yes
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIRUN\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug.
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-run (1),
